  "PythonSetup_Manual_Title": "Manual Setup Instructions",
  "PythonSetup_Manual_Instructions": "[Manual Setup Instructions]\n\n1. Prepare a Python 3.8-3.11 environment. (Using a virtual environment is recommended to avoid conflicts.)\n2. Open a command prompt, navigate to the root directory of this project, and install the dependencies:\n   pip install -r StockAnalyzer.Python/requirements.txt\n3. Open the [StockAnalyzer.Avalonia/appsettings.json] file, and append the absolute path to your python.exe in the [PythonPath] key under the [Python] section.\n\n   Example:\n   \"Python\": {\n     \"PythonPath\": \"C:\\\\path\\\\to\\\\python.exe\"\n   }\n\n*Please restart the application after completing the setup.",
